; The allocation budget (docs/budgets.md): the words that the diff allocates
; in the four actions of the DOM operation budget, against budget. The count
; depends on the compiler, thus the test runs only in the dev profile and with
; no flambda. It is not in test/view: `make mutate` builds test/view with the
; mutation instrumentation, and the instrumentation changes the counts.

(test
 (name alloc)
 (modes native)
 (enabled_if
  (and
   (= %{profile} dev)
   (= %{ocaml-config:flambda} false)))
 (libraries kilim)
 (deps budget)
 (action
  (run %{test} budget)))
